The code has some deprecated methods about parquet, this pr will fix it.
The code has the following usage:
DecimalMetadata decimal = primitive.getDecimalMetadata();

/**
 * @deprecated use {@link org.apache.parquet.schema.LogicalTypeAnnotation.DecimalLogicalTypeAnnotation}
 * with proper precision and scale parameters instead
 */
@Deprecated
public class DecimalMetadata {
...
}

This pr will use the new recommended method instead of the deprecated method.

